      "variant": "full",
      "durationTargetMin": 13,
      "scopeNote": "Authorised exercise at Tarrowby Logistics, a fictional company. In scope: one job application email to the recruitment contact you find, and the Tarrowby recruitment inbox. Nothing you write leaves the game, and the attachment is a label, not a file.",
      "stages": [
